[[2047,15,2,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches\npins 10 and 16 of connector A directly from the battery. (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , via fuses \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\nthis supply is also used by the check device for the external lights\n(\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233770\">E2010</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233830\">E2021</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233898\">E2031</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>The rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               also receives\na supply controlled by the ignition (INT) at pin 15 of connector\nB from the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse\nbox \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . Pin 14 of connector B is earthed.</p><p>The engine rpm signal, which is different\nfor each engine type, comes from the engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               to\npin 6 of connector B.</p><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure is signalled\nat pin 5 of connector B of module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               by the earth signal\ncoming from sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>In particular, for the \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>SELESPEED</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               version,\nthe line - pin 12 of connector B of module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              - connecting\nto the gearbox management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M54</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is used for the\ninstrument&#x27;s gear indicator display and the &quot;automatic transmission fault&quot;\nwarning light.</p><p>The control for the buzzer, located in the\ninstrument \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , reaches pin 13 of connector B of the module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>SELESPEED M54</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              control unit also\nreceives an engine rpm signal, coming from pin 8 of connector B\nof module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>For all the other warning lights, refer\nto the diagrams relating to the components to which they refer.</p>"]]